    "name": "LightSouls",
    "steam_appid": 3844060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This LIGHTSOULS APP, developed with great enthusiasm and passion, focuses on the ARCHETYPES and COSMOGRAMS, i.e. the basic principles of creation and the fascinating symbols based on sacred geometry in the comprehensive spiritual cosmos of GOR RASSADIN and ALTERA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will find comprehensive knowledge about all ARCHETYPES and COSMOGRAPHS in an inspiring multimedia ALTERA-APP</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D multimedia and meditative experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects, mandalas and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive reality controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Functions (selection):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmograms</strong>: Learn all about archetypal cosmograms, their respective functions and how they relate to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/463e7791f790de2a9c3e7d71bc523b81.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily card:</strong> Draw one of 21 cards at random every day or choose the card according to your current interests. The kosmogram being that you encounter will give you the right answer to a topic that concerns you with its BEING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/3effd6c90b745c85a0ff4fe5cfd87db8.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combinations</strong>: You can combine several cards to create a powerful combination that will help you in specific life situations. Or select a specific topic directly and find out which combination you can use for what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/e4e86822b87d79170b00a578ad0102f9.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong>: In three meditative videos created exclusively for this application, you will learn how to control reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a22ca8e2edd8cd5cecd4c1b0a6a2a07b.avif?t=1754639168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactions</strong>: Interact and experience eight 3D models and cosmogram mandalas, some of them animated and developed from scratch for this app.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/d440edfae35f67ba91057f8427d4f52e.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panoptikum</strong>:\u00a0Visit the huge, virtual and interactive exhibition space and experience various exhibits accompanied by music, animations and fascinating computer art based on the powerful 3D cosmograms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a9a56db3715519d42a41bdabb0bbf9d5.avif?t=1754639168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This LIGHTSOULS APP, developed with great enthusiasm and passion, focuses on the ARCHETYPES and COSMOGRAMS, i.e. the basic principles of creation and the fascinating symbols based on sacred geometry in the comprehensive spiritual cosmos of GOR RASSADIN and ALTERA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will find comprehensive knowledge about all ARCHETYPES and COSMOGRAPHS in an inspiring multimedia ALTERA-APP</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D multimedia and meditative experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects, mandalas and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive reality controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Functions (selection):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmograms</strong>: Learn all about archetypal cosmograms, their respective functions and how they relate to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/463e7791f790de2a9c3e7d71bc523b81.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily card:</strong> Draw one of 21 cards at random every day or choose the card according to your current interests. The kosmogram being that you encounter will give you the right answer to a topic that concerns you with its BEING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/3effd6c90b745c85a0ff4fe5cfd87db8.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combinations</strong>: You can combine several cards to create a powerful combination that will help you in specific life situations. Or select a specific topic directly and find out which combination you can use for what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/e4e86822b87d79170b00a578ad0102f9.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong>: In three meditative videos created exclusively for this application, you will learn how to control reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a22ca8e2edd8cd5cecd4c1b0a6a2a07b.avif?t=1754639168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactions</strong>: Interact and experience eight 3D models and cosmogram mandalas, some of them animated and developed from scratch for this app.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/d440edfae35f67ba91057f8427d4f52e.avif?t=1754639168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panoptikum</strong>:\u00a0Visit the huge, virtual and interactive exhibition space and experience various exhibits accompanied by music, animations and fascinating computer art based on the powerful 3D cosmograms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a9a56db3715519d42a41bdabb0bbf9d5.avif?t=1754639168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul>",
